Thought: The mass spectrometry data indicates a molecular ion peak at m/z 268.19, suggesting a molecular weight of approximately 268. This information can be used to deduce the molecular formula. Next, I will use the `obtain_isomers_from_molecular_formula` tool to explore possible isomers that match this molecular weight, which will help in identifying the correct SMILES string.
Action: obtain_isomers_from_molecular_formula
Action Input: {"molecular_formula": "C18H28O2"}

