Action: validate_smiles
Action Input: {"smiles": "CCC(C)(C)C(C1=CC=CC=C1)OOCC2CCCC2"}

Thought: The SMILES string "CCC(C)(C)C(C1=CC=CC=C1)OOCC2CCCC2" is valid. To further confirm if this is the correct structure, I should compare its NMR spectra with typical chemical shifts. I will start by obtaining the proton NMR spectra for this compound.
